        "Define the question, permitted sources, relevant dates, and decision criteria. Retrieve primary sources and follow important context rather than assembling disconnected snippets. Compare terminology and contradictory results, keeping evidence distinct from inference. Use bounded reads and citations tied to actual retrieved passages. Recheck temporally unstable claims before treating them as current.",
