        "Identify source and target language, audience, register, and locale-specific conventions. Preserve names, numbers, product terms, placeholders, URLs, and code. Translate idioms by intended meaning and flag ambiguity that changes interpretation. Keep translation notes out of the final copy unless requested. For structured resources, validate keys and interpolation variables after transformation.",
        "Deliver complete translated content and any essential ambiguity note. Compare placeholders, counts, and formatting with the source. Do not add unsupported factual claims or silently change a legal, financial, or technical qualification."),
