        "Identify the subject, composition, style, aspect ratio, brand text, and permitted references. For editing, confirm that the target image is actually available and preserve elements outside the requested change. Send the brief to the configured image capability rather than pretending prose is an image. Inspect the returned output for the specific requested content and disclose failures or material mismatches.",
        "Return the actual generated or edited image result when supported. Do not claim exact identity, text fidelity, or dimensions that were not verified. Uploading a private reference to an external service requires the authorized data-transfer route."),
