        "Return the requested facts or real output file with a confirmed reference. Describe incomplete retrieval rather than substituting an unrelated source. Never invent a download path, silently overwrite a user file, or transfer private content to an unconfigured destination."),
    librarySkill("graphic-design", "Graphic Design",
